{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "地址变成人",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 114.42,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "数据之外，还有一种暴露，来自链本身。",
   "spoken": "数据之外，还有一种暴露，来自链本身。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.95
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "去匿名化，就是把匿名的链上地址，关联到真实的身份。",
   "spoken": "去匿名化，就是把匿名的链上地址，关联到真实的身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.42,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 5.513,
   "speechEnd": 10.383
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "链上分析先把地址聚成一个个实体，再把实体对上真人。",
   "spoken": "链上分析先把地址聚成一个个实体，再把实体对上真人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 10.84,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 10.934,
   "speechEnd": 16.383
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "第一种方法，共同输入。",
   "spoken": "第一种方法，共同输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 16.82,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 16.913,
   "speechEnd": 18.663
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "一笔比特币交易的多个输入，大概率属于同一个所有者。",
   "spoken": "一笔比特币交易的多个输入，大概率属于同一个所有者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.04,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 19.04,
   "speechEnd": 23.31
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "第二种，找零地址，认出交易里找零给自己的那个输出。",
   "spoken": "第二种，找零地址，认出交易里找零给自己的那个输出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 23.74,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 23.74,
   "speechEnd": 28.916
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第三种，交易所出入金。",
   "spoken": "第三种，交易所出入金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 29.32,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 29.32,
   "speechEnd": 31.54
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "地址跟交易所的充值地址有往来，而交易所掌握 KYC。",
   "spoken": "地址跟交易所的充值地址有往来，而交易所掌握 KYC。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 31.94,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 32.036,
   "speechEnd": 37.267
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "第四种，跨链、跨混币器的时间和金额模式。",
   "spoken": "第四种，跨链、跨混币器的时间和金额模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 37.68,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 37.68,
   "speechEnd": 41.543
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "第五种，链下关联，ENS 名称、社交媒体上贴出的地址、NFT 头像。",
   "spoken": "第五种，链下关联，ENS 名称、社交媒体上贴出的地址、NFT 头像。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 41.98,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 41.98,
   "speechEnd": 48.565
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "这些都是启发式规则，会误判。",
   "spoken": "这些都是启发式规则，会误判。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 49.0,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 49.094,
   "speechEnd": 51.632
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "比如一笔交易，有 4 个输入，4 个金额相等的输出。",
   "spoken": "比如一笔交易，有 4 个输入，4 个金额相等的输出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 52.1,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 52.199,
   "speechEnd": 56.472
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "共同输入规则，会把 4 个输入，归给同一个人。",
   "spoken": "共同输入规则，会把 4 个输入，归给同一个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 56.88,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 56.974,
   "speechEnd": 60.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "可这是典型的 CoinJoin，可能是 4 个人各出一个输入。",
   "spoken": "可这是典型的 CoinJoin，可能是 4 个人各出一个输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 60.78,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 60.78,
   "speechEnd": 64.949
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "聚到一起，一个人的 KYC 身份，就扩散到了另外 3 个人身上。",
   "spoken": "聚到一起，一个人的 KYC 身份，就扩散到了另外 3 个人身上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 65.4,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 65.4,
   "speechEnd": 69.925
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "这套方法，已经走进了法庭。",
   "spoken": "这套方法，已经走进了法庭。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 70.34,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 70.438,
   "speechEnd": 72.705
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "Bitcoin Fog 是一个混币器，经手 120 万余枚比特币。",
   "spoken": "Bitcoin Fog 是一个混币器，经手 120 万余枚比特币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 73.12,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 73.23,
   "speechEnd": 77.513
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "2024 年 3 月，陪审团裁定，运营者 Roman Sterlingov 四项罪名成立。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 3 月，陪审团裁定，运营者 Roman Sterlingov 四项罪名成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 77.98,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 77.98,
   "speechEnd": 83.464
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "法官经过专门听证，认定 Chainalysis Reactor 的分析可以作为证据。",
   "spoken": "法官经过专门听证，认定 Chainalysis Reactor 的分析可以作为证据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 83.88,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 83.88,
   "speechEnd": 89.001
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "同时，还有卧底交易等其他证据印证。",
   "spoken": "同时，还有卧底交易等其他证据印证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 89.38,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 89.38,
   "speechEnd": 92.55
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "2026 年 9 月，上诉法院维持定罪，没有要求公开工具的源代码。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 9 月，上诉法院维持定罪，没有要求公开工具的源代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 92.96,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 93.064,
   "speechEnd": 98.836
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "混币和换地址，不等于匿名。",
   "spoken": "混币和换地址，不等于匿名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 99.26,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 99.26,
   "speechEnd": 101.819
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-22",
   "text": "交易所的出入金记录，往往是把地址落到真人身上的关键一环。",
   "spoken": "交易所的出入金记录，往往是把地址落到真人身上的关键一环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg4-22.wav",
   "start": 102.28,
